aid twice. ACH wasn't needed.\n\n**Harbor's other invoices:**\n- **INV-10981 ($7,973.13):** I didn't pay it because it's still a draft waiting for approval.\n- **INV-16115 ($6,066.76):** It was already marked paid.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need the controller's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}